                    "content": "```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nconst long long MOD = 1000000007;\n\nlong long fact[1005], inv_fact[1005];\n\nlong long power(long long a, long long b, long long mod) {\n    long long result = 1;\n    a %= mod;\n    while (b > 0) {\n        if (b & 1) result = result * a % mod;\n        a = a * a % mod;\n        b >>= 1;\n    }\n    return result;\n}\n\nvoid precompute(int n) {\n    fact[0] = 1;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n        fact[i] = fact[i-1] * i % MOD;\n    }\n    inv_fact[n] = power(fact[n], MOD - 2, MOD);\n    for (int i = n - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n        inv_fact[i] = inv_fact[i+1] * (i+1) % MOD;\n    }\n}\n\nlong long C(int n, int r) {\n    if (r < 0 || r > n) return 0;\n    return fact[n] * inv_fact[r] % MOD * inv_fact[n-r] % MOD;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int n, x, pos;\n    cin >> n >> x >> pos;\n    \n    precompute(n);\n    \n    int lo = 0, hi = n;\n    int less_cnt = 0, greater_cnt = 0;\n    \n    while (lo < hi) {\n        int mid = (lo + hi) / 2;\n        if (mid == pos) {\n            break;\n        } else if (mid < pos) {\n            less_cnt++;\n            lo = mid + 1;\n        } else {\n            greater_cnt++;\n            hi = mid;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    long long ans = C(x - 1, less_cnt) * fact[less_cnt] % MOD;\n    ans = ans * C(n - x, greater_cnt) % MOD * fact[greater_cnt] % MOD;\n    ans = ans * fact[n - 1 - less_cnt - greater_cnt] % MOD;\n    \n    cout << ans << endl;\n    \n    return 0;\n}\n```",
